      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft of the crisis comms statement, aiming to convey empathy and support without directly admitting liability:\n\n\"At [Airline Name], we understand the frustration and inconvenience faced by our passengers due to the lost luggage incident over the weekend. We share your disappointment and are committed to helping you get your essential items back as soon as possible. Our team is working diligently to reunite passengers with their belongings and minimize further disruptions. We appreciate your patience and understanding as we work to resolve this situation.\"\n\nThis statement maintains a neutral tone, acknowledging the issue without explicitly taking responsibility, while also showing empathy and a commitment to resolving the problem.",
