      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a revised draft:\n\n\"We understand the significant inconvenience and stress caused by the lost luggage incident over the weekend, and we want to assure you that we're taking immediate action to help our passengers recover their essential items. We're expediting the processing of luggage claims and working closely with our teams to ensure that affected passengers receive their belongings as soon as possible. We appreciate the patience and understanding of our passengers as we work to resolve this situation, and we're committed to providing support and updates as needed. If you have lost any items, please contact our 24/7 customer service team so we can assist in reuniting you with what's missing.\"\n\nThis revised statement aims to provide more detail about the steps being taken to resolve the issue, acknowledge the stress and inconvenience caused to passengers, and show empathy and commitment to supporting them.",
